+# Revision — run 01M2183254XQ3HJ45SR4P1Y2X6
+
+- status reviewed: succeeded
+- review: .fabro/reviews/develop/01M2183254XQ3HJ45SR4P1Y2X6.md
+- seeds filed:
+  - fabro-3c6c — Cost-tier implementer smoke checks: parse-level proof for config-only seeds, sized timeouts for built checks
+  - fabro-c419 — Wire the planner's fabro_runs_list binding — the in-flight-PR guard silently fails open
+  - fabro-fe15 — Bake a debug fabro-cli (or shared cargo cache) into the run toolchain image
+- basis: run 01M2183254XQ3HJ45SR4P1Y2X6, workflow version 84429d0a3253eaa52e2406a04a3b97b4365d0ff68b0cdc2f46c296e8c05ec7a6, commit 0dc16012c16ee2f6b2e61ecc73afcf0bd5f26b3d
+- revised_at_commit: 0dc16012c16ee2f6b2e61ecc73afcf0bd5f26b3d (ADR-0015: engine drift signal for later judgement)
+
+## Findings
+
+### Cost-tier implementer smoke checks: parse-level proof for config-only seeds, sized timeouts for built checks
+- filed: fabro-3c6c
+- Concrete change: in `.fabro/workflows/develop/prompts/implementer.md` step 4, config-only seeds verify via tomllib/toml parse (never build); built checks use one `cargo build` with `timeout_ms >= 600000` then `target/debug/<bin>`, timed-out build retried once with doubled timeout, only non-zero exit is failure. One cheapest-first line mirrored in `.fabro/workflows/develop/prompts/planner.md` step 6.
+- Expected effect: config-only runs finish ~4 min instead of ~12 (this run: 600s tool time, $0.146), one wasted diagnosis LLM turn saved per config-only seed.
+
+### Wire the planner's fabro_runs_list binding — the in-flight-PR guard silently fails open
+- filed: fabro-c419 (capability-affecting: `needs-user,revision`, ADR-0019, awaits explicit user approval)
+- Concrete change: make the engine honor node-level `fabro_tools` (or set run-level `agent.fabro_tools` for develop); reword planner.md step 4 to journal degraded mode when the tool is absent. Node declares it (events seq 27 show it absent from the agent toolset, `agent.fabro_tools=false`).
+- Expected effect: the double-pick guard (fabro-06e0/fabro-d0c7 lineage) actually functions, preventing a duplicated ~$0.15/~12-min run when a seed PR waits in gate. Run-level-warning sub-item excluded as duplicate of open fabro-5b0a.
+
+### Bake a debug fabro-cli (or shared cargo cache) into the run toolchain image
+- filed: fabro-fe15 (capability-affecting: `needs-user,revision`, ADR-0019, awaits explicit user approval — touches `.fabro/Dockerfile*` agent-reachable surface)
+- Concrete change: pre-build debug `fabro-cli` in the `fabro-toolchain:noble` image or share a cargo cache across run containers so `target/debug/fabro` exists at start (run probed empty `target/`, seq 107).
+- Expected effect: first cargo invocation drops from minutes to seconds; complements the smoke cost-tiering. Distinct from fabro-cfd6 (CI gate image) and closed fabro-513e.
